# --- Data (MILK10k is ~GBs of images; download it locally, never commit it) ---
data/raw/*
data/processed/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
!data/processed/.gitkeep
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.crdownload
*.part
*.parquet

# Generated CSV/JSON artefacts are ignored by default...
data/processed/*.csv
!data/processed/.gitkeep

# ...but the pipeline outputs (splits, label map, weights, summaries) are small
# and MUST be committed - they are the evidence the pipeline is reproducible.
!artifacts/
!artifacts/**

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.python-version

# --- Jupyter ---
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*-checkpoint.ipynb

# --- Editors / OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Secrets ---
.env
*.pem

# --- Submission bundle (derived) ---
# Finished/ and the zip are assembled from files already committed elsewhere in
# this repo by scripts/build_submission_folder.py. Committing them would duplicate
# ~15 MB. Regenerate with: python scripts/build_submission_folder.py
Finished/
*_CVSR_Sessions_*.zip
